Happy Path
TC-01: Send gift successfully with sufficient balance
Category: Happy Path
Priority: P0
Preconditions:
User is authenticated with valid Sanctum token
User joined room 12345
Wallet balance = 10000 coins
Gift coin price = 500
Room contains at least 10 viewers
Unique valid idempotency_key
Steps:
Send POST request with valid room_id, gift_id, quantity=10, winners_count=5 and valid idempotency_key.
Expected Result:
Status = 200
transaction_id generated
coins_charged = 5000
remaining_balance = 5000
winners list contains 5 unique users
gift.sent event broadcasted
Wallet updated correctly in DB
Why it matters: Verifies the complete successful business flow.
TC-02: Send gift using minimum valid values
Category: Happy Path
Priority: P1
Preconditions: Authenticated user, sufficient balance.
Steps:
Send request with quantity=1 and winners_count=1.
Expected Result:
Status = 200
Transaction created successfully
Correct coin deduction
Why it matters: Validates lower boundary values.
TC-03: Send gift when wallet balance exactly equals required amount
Category: Happy Path
Priority: P0
Preconditions: Wallet balance equals gift cost exactly.
Steps:
Send gift request.
Expected Result:
Status = 200
Transaction succeeds
Remaining balance = 0
Why it matters: Detects boundary calculation bugs.
Field Validation
TC-04: Send request without room_id
Category: Validation
Priority: P1
Preconditions: Authenticated user.
Steps: Remove room_id from request.
Expected Result: Status = 422, validation error, no transaction created.
Why it matters: Prevents orphan transactions.
